class_name SolarSystem
extends VisualEffect

## Solar system (太阳系): an animated star and its planets, generated by the triplanar noise shaders
## of the upstream "Godot 3D Planet Generator" (vendored shaders and noise presets next to this file).
##
## A [SubViewport] renders a real 3D scene above the chat: the star, seven planets with atmospheres,
## clouds, Saturn's rings and an asteroid belt, plus a procedural starfield. Streaming tokens feed the
## star, tools send a probe to one planet, a finished tool flashes that planet, and a failure scatters
## debris. The whole overlay keeps a low authored alpha so the conversation stays readable.

# --- Upstream planet generator assets (MIT, Rémi / remijean) --------------------------------
